To adjust BGP path selection to prioritize routes with RPKI-validated origins over those without RPKI data, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp best-path-selection compare-origin-validation-state
```

This command modifies the BGP decision process to prefer routes in the order:
1. **Valid** (passed RPKI origin check)
