This configuration:
- Starts with a 10-minute initial cooldown (`initial-wait`)
- Doubles the wait time after each subsequent failure (`second-wait` sets the doubling base to 20 minutes)
- Caps maximum idle time at 120 minutes (2 hours, `max-wait`)
- Requires 45 minutes of stable operation (`error-interval`) to reset the penalty counter

