To ensure smooth BGP peer recovery after a reboot and prevent premature route withdrawal on your Nokia 7750 SR, enable BGP Graceful Restart helper mode. This retains stale routes during the peer's restart, allowing stable forwarding while the peer rebuilds its tables.

**Configuration Commands:**
```cli
