To achieve BGP multipath with up to 8 next-hop options for IPv4 and request multiple paths from peers, configure the following:

```console
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        neighbor <neighbor-ip>
            no next-hop-self
            family ipv4
                add-paths send 8 receive
            exit
        exit
    exit
