- `no next-hop-self` preserves original next-hop attributes instead of overriding them with the local router's address
- `add-paths send 8 receive` enables:
  - Advertising up to 8 distinct paths per IPv4 prefix
  - Requesting peers to send multiple paths in return
- Configured per-neighbor under the IPv4 address family
- Maintains compatibility with route reflection scenarios

Replace `<group-name>` and `<neighbor-ip>` with your specific BGP group and peer address.
