To immediately terminate the BGP session when the path to the neighbor becomes unreachable, adjust the BGP hold-time to the minimum value. This ensures the session drops quickly if keepalives fail, instead of waiting for the default hold timer.

```cli
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address> hold-time 3
